{"id":67365,"date":"2025-11-01T21:03:41","date_gmt":"2025-11-01T20:03:41","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67365"},"modified":"2026-09-12T09:19:53","modified_gmt":"2026-09-12T08:19:53","slug":"trail-falcao-real","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-falcao-real\/","title":{"rendered":"VII TRAIL DO FALC\u00c3O REAL 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">VII TRAIL DO FALC\u00c3O REAL 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>VII Trail do Falc\u00e3o Real 2026<\/strong> afirma-se como uma das mais aut\u00eanticas e desafiantes celebra\u00e7\u00f5es de trail running no sotavento algarvio, levando centenas de atletas a explorar as paisagens selvagens e escarpadas do concelho raiano de <strong>Alcoutim<\/strong>. Organizada com dedica\u00e7\u00e3o pela <strong>Sec\u00e7\u00e3o de Trail do Grupo Desportivo de Alcoutim<\/strong>, em estreita colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com o <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Alcoutim<\/strong> e a <strong>Uni\u00e3o das Freguesias de Alcoutim e Pereiro<\/strong>, a prova realiza-se no domingo, <strong>13 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, tendo como cen\u00e1rio de partida e chegada o emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Cais de Embarque de Alcoutim<\/strong>, junto \u00e0s \u00e1guas serenas do Rio Guadiana.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa desportivo apresenta op\u00e7\u00f5es para todos os n\u00edveis de prepara\u00e7\u00e3o: o exigente <strong>Trail Longo de 32 km<\/strong> com cerca de 1.500 metros de desn\u00edvel positivo acumulado (classifica\u00e7\u00e3o de dificuldade ATRP 2), o din\u00e2mico <strong>Trail Sprint de 17 km<\/strong> com 920m D+ (dificuldade ATRP 3), o acess\u00edvel <strong>Mini Trail de 10 km<\/strong> (295m D+), a tradicional <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> e as corridas l\u00fadicas de <strong>Trail Kids<\/strong> para os mais jovens. Os participantes contam com secretariado dispon\u00edvel desde a v\u00e9spera, controlo de seguran\u00e7a rigoroso, postos de abastecimento s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos ao longo dos trilhos, balne\u00e1rios com duches quentes no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal e o tradicional conv\u00edvio final com oferta de sandes e bebida a todos os atletas concluintes.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">13 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Cais de Embarque de Alcoutim, Alcoutim, Faro<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">32 km, 17 km, 10 km (Mini Trail \/ Caminhada) e Trail Kids<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-wid