style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (1 a 6 Dez)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Mini Trail 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30 \u2022 295m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 17.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30 Nov)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (1 a 6 Dez)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:35 \u2022 295m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Sem T-Shirt:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 6 Dez)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Com T-Shirt:<\/strong> 17.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30 Nov)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Kids<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:50<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Gratuito<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, o local de concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e os hor\u00e1rios de partida do VII Trail do Falc\u00e3o Real 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, 13 de dezembro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas instaladas no Cais de Embarque de Alcoutim. O secretariado abre \u00e0s 07:15 e as partidas escalonadas t\u00eam in\u00edcio \u00e0s 09:00 para o Trail Longo (32 km), 09:15 para o Trail Sprint (17 km), 09:30 para o Mini Trail (10 km), 09:35 para a Caminhada (10 km) e 09:50 para o Trail Kids.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e respetivos desn\u00edveis acumulados?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova disponibiliza quatro dist\u00e2ncias principais: Trail Longo de 32 km com 1.500m D+ (n\u00edvel ATRP 2), Trail Sprint de 17 km com 920m D+ (n\u00edvel ATRP 3), Mini Trail de 10 km com 295m D+ e Caminhada guiada de 10 km com 295m D+, al\u00e9m de percursos recreativos infantis no Trail Kids.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde pode ser levantado o secretariado e dorsal do atleta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no s\u00e1bado, 12 de dezembro, das 17:00 \u00e0s 20:00 na sede do Grupo Desportivo de Alcoutim, e no domingo, 13 de dezembro, entre as 07:15 e as 08:45 no local de partida (Cais de Embarque de Alcoutim), mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o de documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o oficial.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo no valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail do Falc\u00e3o Real?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o garante dorsal com chip de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, seguro desportivo de acidentes pessoais, abastecimentos l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos nos postos do percurso, brinde\/t-shirt oficial do evento (para inscri\u00e7\u00f5es no prazo indicado), banhos quentes no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Alcoutim e sandes com bebida na chegada.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as idades m\u00ednimas de participa\u00e7\u00e3o e regras para menores?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A participa\u00e7\u00e3o no Trail Longo de 32 km e Trail Sprint de 17 km exige a idade m\u00ednima de 18 anos \u00e0 data da prova. Na Caminhada e Mini Trail de 10 km \u00e9 permitida a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o de menores, desde que acompanhados por declara\u00e7\u00e3o e termo de responsabilidade devidamente assinado pelo encarregado de educa\u00e7\u00e3o com c\u00f3pia do documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"VII TRAIL DO FALC\u00c3O REAL 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-13\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Cais de Embarque de Alcoutim, Alcoutim\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Alcoutim\", \"addressRegion\": \"Faro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Sec\u00e7\u00e3o de Trail do Grupo Desportivo de Alcoutim e Munic\u00edpio de Alcoutim\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data, o local de concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e os hor\u00e1rios de partida do VII Trail do Falc\u00e3o Real 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 13 de dezembro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas instaladas no Cais de Embarque de Alcoutim. O secretariado abre \u00e0s 07:15 e as partidas escalonadas t\u00eam in\u00edcio \u00e0s 09:00 para o Trail Longo (32 km), 09:15 para o Trail Sprint (17 km), 09:30 para o Mini Trail (10 km), 09:35 para a Caminhada (10 km) e 09:50 para o Trail Kids.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e respetivos desn\u00edveis acumulados?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova disponibiliza quatro dist\u00e2ncias principais: Trail Longo de 32 km com 1.500m D+ (n\u00edvel ATRP 2), Trail Sprint de 17 km com 920m D+ (n\u00edvel ATRP 3), Mini Trail de 10 km com 295m D+ e Caminhada guiada de 10 km com 295m D+, al\u00e9m de percursos recreativos infantis no Trail Kids.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde pode ser levantado o secretariado e dorsal do atleta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado funciona no s\u00e1bado, 12 de dezembro, das 17:00 \u00e0s 20:00 na sede do Grupo Desportivo de Alcoutim, e no domingo, 13 de dezembro, entre as 07:15 e as 08:45 no local de partida (Cais de Embarque de Alcoutim), mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o de documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o oficial.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo no valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail do Falc\u00e3o Real?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o garante dorsal com chip de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, seguro desportivo de acidentes pessoais, abastecimentos l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos nos postos do percurso, brinde\/t-shirt oficial do evento (para inscri\u00e7\u00f5es no prazo indicado), banhos quentes no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Alcoutim e sandes com bebida na chegada.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as idades m\u00ednimas de participa\u00e7\u00e3o e regras para menores?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A participa\u00e7\u00e3o no Trail Longo de 32 km e Trail Sprint de 17 km exige a idade m\u00ednima de 18 anos \u00e0 data da prova. Na Caminhada e Mini Trail de 10 km \u00e9 permitida a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o de menores, desde que acompanhados por declara\u00e7\u00e3o e termo de responsabilidade devidamente assinado pelo encarregado de educa\u00e7\u00e3o com c\u00f3pia do documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67366,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,739,498],"event_type_2":[728,149,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-67365","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-alcoutim-faro","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-kids-trail","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_2-faro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_5-circuito-atrp"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-trail-falcao-real.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/67365","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=67365"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/67365\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":67368,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/67365\/revisions\/67368"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/67366"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=67365"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json